title: Palo Alto: Sessions (XML API)
agents: palo_alto_api
catalog: hw/network/palo_alto
license: GPLv3
distribution: kuhn-ruess
description:
 This check monitors the session table of a Palo Alto Networks firewall as read
 from {show session info} through the PAN-OS XML API. It reports the session
 table utilization (active vs. supported sessions) together with the number of
 active TCP, UDP and ICMP sessions and the connections-per-second rate.

 The service goes {WARN} or {CRIT} when the utilization exceeds the configured
 upper levels (default 80 / 90 %).

discovery:
 One service is created when session information is available.
